{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星楊冪和華語歌王林俊傑（JJ）早前同台演出，她更兌現一年前的點歌約定，為對方擔任伴舞。</p><p>楊冪以靚絕造型艷壓全場，為之前的炒車Look一雪前恥。</p><p>而同場的「資深Coser」汪東城當然不忘變裝登場，大晒結實胸肌及腹肌，令粉絲睇到尖叫。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T16:21:50.423034+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T16:01:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T16:18:22.983942+00:00","content_hash":"2c0e3ad16de4502f626be532bc4221d0cc3086e2d89c56bbe3273ea4cb93a748","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}